msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With Quarkus 2.2, the dispatching strategy of RESTEasy _reactive_ becomes "
"smarter thus improving the developer experience."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You don't need to learn the reactive way; you can keep using imperative code."
""
msgstr ""

msgid "You don't need to think about your threads; Quarkus does that for you."
msgstr ""

msgid "You don't lose in flexibility; you can override the decision."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Starting with Quarkus 2.3, the Quarkus team is thinking of making RESTEasy "
"_reactive_  the default way to implement HTTP APIs.\n"
"It does not mean that the RESTEasy _classic_ extension will be retired, just "
"that we reach the point where RESTEasy _reactive_ gives you more without "
"burden."
msgstr ""
